  "name": "telescope-guzzle-watcher",
  "full_name": "huzaifaarain/telescope-guzzle-watcher",
  "description": "Telescope Guzzle Watcher provide a custom watcher for intercepting http requests made via guzzlehttp/guzzle php library. The package uses the on_stats request option for extracting the request/response data. The watcher intercept and log the request into the Laravel Telescope HTTP Client Watcher.",
  "description_ja": "Telescope Guzzle Watcher は、guzzlehttp/guzzle PHP ライブラリ経由の HTTP リクエストを傍受するカスタムウォッチャーです。on_stats リクエストオプションでリクエスト/レスポンスデータを抽出し、Laravel Telescope の HTTP Client Watcher にリクエストを記録します。",
  "url": "https://github.com/huzaifaarain/telescope-guzzle-watcher",
